  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening COVID-19 Prevention and Response for Remote and Hard-To-Reach Communities in BARMM and its Neighboring Regions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will support COVID-19 vaccination campaign through the provision of community-driven mobile vaccination clinics and capacity-building for enhancement of infection prevention and control measures in points of entries to provide communities better protection from COVID-19 associated risks and its effects. This will take place in the Bangsamoro Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao (BARMM).</narrative>
  </description>
